Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.61,0:00:05.64,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,小蝶 过得还顺心吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.18,0:00:08.47,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,上次把你卷到大麻烦里
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.64,0:00:10.28,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,真的很抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.95,0:00:14.13,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,现在有两个Precure了 对方大概是有点怕了吧...？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.34,0:00:17.64,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,卡疤痛再也没有来过
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.01,0:00:19.81,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,小空每天的心情也很好
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.10,0:00:21.61,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.00,0:00:23.74,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,马上就要开学了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.12,0:00:27.68,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,你说过会开车来上学来着 没有问题吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.98,0:00:30.35,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,住到我家里来就好了嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.90,0:00:35.01,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,我还会给你写信的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.08,0:00:41.34,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 还有
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.75,0:00:45.83,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,小晴最近好像总是做噩梦
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.45,0:00:50.40,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,如果有助眠的好方法 请告诉我们
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.42,0:00:56.52,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,呜... 呜...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.11,0:01:06.12,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.13,0:01:34.50,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,真白同学！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.96,0:01:48.55,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,又是这个梦...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.18,0:03:29.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,0)}{\c&HFCB856&\3c&HFFF4DE&\4c&HFFFFFF&}手牵起了手！我们的新招！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.98,0:03:34.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,关于Precure究竟是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.57,0:03:38.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我调查了一下古书 找到了答案
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.87,0:03:40.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看好了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.39,0:03:42.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个事件后世称为暴风之夜
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.25,0:03:46.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,黑暗世界的魔物 向蓝天大地发起进攻
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.25,0:03:46.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50\pos(1110,960)}Sky Land
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.11,0:03:51.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,蓝天被乌云笼罩 人们开始了绝望的抗争
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.45,0:03:54.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,蓝天大地的公主向天祈祷
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.89,0:03:59.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请天降英雄 夺回我们的蓝天与人民的笑容
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.92,0:04:05.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可能是公主的祈祷传达给了上苍 勇敢的战士挺身而出
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.57,0:04:07.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她就是Precure
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.74,0:04:12.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Precure击退了黑暗世界的魔物 拯救了蓝天大地
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.18,0:04:19.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这就是蓝天大地已被渐渐忘却的古老传说
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.11,0:04:25.68,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,传说中的战士... Precure！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.88,0:04:26.87,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.06,0:04:30.82,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,小空 可以彻底放心了！有传说中的英雄做你的后盾！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.00,0:04:32.08,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.29,0:04:37.59,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,对啊 小空不可思议的力量 是蓝天大地的公主神力吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.78,0:04:42.33,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 我啊 现在爆发出一股想要大炼特炼疯狂锻炼的冲动呢！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.66,0:04:45.70,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,小晴我们现在就去跑步吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.66,0:04:48.65,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,小晴？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.83,0:04:50.23,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,Precure先放一边
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.48,0:04:54.93,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,什么时候能够打开 通往蓝天大地的通道？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.15,0:04:56.08,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.35,0:04:58.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再给我一点时间
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.63,0:05:01.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这不是很简单的工程
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.86,0:05:05.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,必须使用100种以上的素材 精确地手工调配 再之后...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.07,0:05:09.70,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,卡疤痛不是轻而易举地就打开了通道吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.97,0:05:13.74,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,对... 对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.60,0:05:15.67,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,小晴？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.89,0:05:17.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是个好孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.46,0:05:18.40,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.96,0:05:22.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\c&H15369B&\3c&H000000&\3a&HFF&\4c&H000000&\4a&HFF&\pos(1166,697)}{\fs50\c&H0B1949&}关\N东\N煮
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.02,0:05:29.45,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,我还是个臭小鬼的时候 就明白这里不好使了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.82,0:05:32.06,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,但是对这里是很有自信的！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.27,0:05:33.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.64,0:05:37.66,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,可是偏偏却出现了叫做Precure的 强到没边的丫头啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.02,0:05:39.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.53,0:05:41.75,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,而且突然又冒出了第二个！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.93,0:05:44.55,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,我的立场会变得怎么样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.81,0:05:47.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请你的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.73,0:05:49.97,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,老爹...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.71,0:05:57.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.80,0:05:58.89,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,难道是...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.62,0:06:02.44,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,还没有抓到天空公主吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.71,0:06:04.92,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.31,0:06:09.87,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,你这没用的蠢猪 还要让我失望多少次
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.06,0:06:12.60,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,非... 非常抱歉！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.15,0:06:16.14,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,别以为机会是无限次的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.59,0:06:18.74,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,把公主带到我这里来...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.05,0:06:20.53,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,明白了吗 卡疤痛
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.85,0:06:22.12,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,遵命！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.40,0:06:29.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是... 是你单位里滥用职权发泄的上司吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.58,0:06:31.42,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,我不客气了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.57,0:06:32.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.14,0:06:35.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.15,0:06:40.22,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,Precure！今天就是你们的末日！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.17,0:06:43.53,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,好烫！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.50,0:06:46.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\c&HB790F7&\3c&H000000&\3a&HFF&\4c&H000000&\4a&HFF&\frz3.406\pos(1058,323)}唯美着迷
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.32,0:06:49.03,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,快看 出新款了！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.09,0:06:53.28,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,小晴？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.47,0:06:54.85,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.45,0:07:03.94,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,你有什么心事吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.21,0:07:08.38,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,跟我说吧 好不好？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.47,0:07:11.40,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！难道是！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.53,0:07:18.73,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,我使出棱镜光流的时候 模仿你的天空拳\N\N加了“英雄少女” 所以不开心了？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.90,0:07:19.89,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,不是的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.43,0:07:23.35,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,是吗 那是为什么...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.66,0:07:28.56,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,真白同学
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.30,0:07:34.26,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我希望你不要再变身成Precure了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.70,0:07:39.03,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.63,0:07:43.65,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,是吗 你做的是那种噩梦啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.29,0:07:46.61,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我明白的 那只是梦
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.02,0:07:51.78,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢你担心我 可是啊 我们一定要保护小空的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.48,0:07:56.06,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,而且讲道理 相比1个人 那肯定是2个人更放心吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.31,0:07:57.76,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,让我1个人去战斗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.95,0:08:00.54,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我想说的是 只要我变得更强 你就不用战斗了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.15,0:08:02.47,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,小晴...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.65,0:08:09.15,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,（怪声）
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.89,0:08:12.24,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧 来吧 来吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.56,0:08:21.42,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,我注入全部的关东煮卡路里！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.10,0:08:25.24,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧！暗塌谷能量！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.31,0:08:38.15,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱暴兽！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.97,0:08:43.18,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,成了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.52,0:08:46.72,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,终于弄出来了 看吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.99,0:08:51.33,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,这就是我资历里 最大最强的乱暴兽！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.02,0:09:00.00,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,离站前进！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.92,0:09:06.14,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,通知各位龙套们！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.33,0:09:10.14,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,你们太碍事了 请退至白线的外侧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.42,0:09:12.32,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,叫你们让开 混蛋！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.53,0:09:13.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,呀！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.55,0:09:16.88,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,快出来 Precure！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.27,0:09:20.47,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,我要让你们搞清楚 谁才是真的强！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.09,0:09:24.38,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,然后再收下小公主！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.91,0:09:27.39,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.63,0:09:32.02,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,小空麻烦你照顾了！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.20,0:09:33.68,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,诶？等等！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.30,0:09:35.89,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,且看我英雄亮相！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.00,0:09:42.58,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,天空幻镜！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.00,0:09:42.58,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Sky Mirage！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.32,0:09:45.87,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,天籁接通！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.32,0:09:45.87,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Tone Connect！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.80,0:09:52.46,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,海阔天空变身！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.28,0:09:55.25,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,天空！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.28,0:09:55.25,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Sky！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.48,0:10:04.82,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,闪耀起步！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.48,0:10:04.82,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50\pos(995,970)}HOP
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.40,0:10:12.92,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,爽朗飞奔！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.40,0:10:12.92,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50\pos(995,970)}STEP
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.20,0:10:20.91,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,畅快跃起！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.20,0:10:20.91,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50\pos(995,970)}JUMP
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.44,0:10:43.69,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,广阔无限的蓝天！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.06,0:10:46.34,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,Cure Sky！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.06,0:10:46.34,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}天空愈卫！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.95,0:10:52.64,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,我也来... 啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.79,0:10:53.82,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.37,0:11:01.99,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,哼 1个人吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.51,0:11:05.60,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,孤独一人也不畏惧！这才是英雄！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.91,0:11:12.05,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,逞什么英雄 我可是要比你更强啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.65,0:11:15.26,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.45,0:11:22.96,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,英雄少女·天空拳
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.45,0:11:22.96,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Hero Girl Sky Punch
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.13,0:11:25.48,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.81,0:11:27.04,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.63,0:11:35.94,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,呀！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.79,0:11:38.70,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.84,0:11:40.74,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.90,0:11:41.93,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,小空...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.78,0:11:44.76,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.62,0:11:47.37,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.94,0:11:49.06,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,诶！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.45,0:11:55.90,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空？小空！小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.97,0:11:59.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个应该会帮到你们大忙的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.66,0:12:04.11,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,奶奶 太谢谢你了！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.28,0:12:05.39,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,这下就可以了！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.71,0:12:08.10,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,等我一下 小晴！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.50,0:12:15.05,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,天空幻镜！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.50,0:12:15.05,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Sky Mirage！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.90,0:12:18.33,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,天籁接通！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.90,0:12:18.33,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Tone Connect！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.94,0:12:24.63,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,海阔天空变身！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.74,0:12:27.62,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,棱镜！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.74,0:12:27.62,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Prism！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.83,0:12:37.27,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,闪耀起步！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.83,0:12:37.27,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50\pos(995,970)}HOP
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.91,0:12:45.45,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,爽朗飞奔！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.91,0:12:45.45,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50\pos(995,970)}STEP
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.65,0:12:53.41,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,畅快跃起！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.65,0:12:53.41,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50\pos(995,970)}JUMP
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.02,0:13:16.75,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,辽阔拂远的柔光！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.69,0:13:19.02,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,Cure Prism！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.69,0:13:19.02,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}棱镜愈卫！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.37,0:13:24.52,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,小空 我们走！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.70,0:13:25.61,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.65,0:13:32.63,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,哈哈哈哈 弱爆了！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.38,0:13:38.16,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,Sky！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.74,0:13:42.14,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,小空在飞
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.32,0:13:43.48,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.17,0:13:44.86,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,能站起来吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.89,0:13:48.23,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我没事的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.09,0:13:51.85,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,来了啊 第2个
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.26,0:13:55.24,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,第3个... 也跟着！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.43,0:13:59.74,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,小公主我不客气了！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.26,0:14:12.51,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,小公主我不客气了！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.96,0:14:16.69,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.36,0:14:23.12,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,现在广播寻人
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.38,0:14:24.97,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,Precure女士们！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.24,0:14:28.38,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,胆小鬼跑哪去了！快滚出来！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.89,0:14:31.97,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,好危险
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.81,0:14:35.33,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,现在不是闹别扭的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.81,0:14:37.90,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,我们一起战斗吧？好不好？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.43,0:14:39.40,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,不要
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.61,0:14:40.81,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.97,0:14:41.71,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,但是...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.87,0:14:42.94,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,因为是朋友...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.30,0:14:45.35,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.23,0:14:49.83,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,因为真白同学是我第一个朋友啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.31,0:14:55.08,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,从那一天 从那一个瞬间开始 我就开始...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.89,0:14:58.95,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,为了成为英雄 开始锻炼身体
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.48,0:15:03.83,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,哼！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.38,0:15:08.39,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,诶！诶！咜！哒！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.56,0:15:22.23,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！呀！诶！呀！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.54,0:15:23.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个真漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.75,0:15:24.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很衬你呢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.29,0:15:26.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,买到就赚到了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.11,0:15:28.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的很可爱！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.81,0:15:30.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对吧 也想要一个了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.58,0:15:31.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们下次再去逛吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.06,0:15:33.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.79,0:15:36.43,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,这是我自己决定的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.75,0:15:39.41,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,所以自己要承受住
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.51,0:15:44.55,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,孤独一人也不畏惧！这才是英雄！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.37,0:15:48.45,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,可是...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.44,0:15:52.09,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我交到朋友了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.09,0:15:56.71,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,在上架前 我就有留意商品信息 一直在攒零花钱！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.42,0:16:00.50,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,但是现在需要这个的不是我
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.68,0:16:02.21,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,而是小晴你
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.71,0:16:04.91,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么样？让我送你一份礼物吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.23,0:16:07.68,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我明白我很任性！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.09,0:16:09.64,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,但是我害怕啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.87,0:16:14.56,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我不愿意真白同学受伤 哪怕是一根毫毛...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.97,0:16:17.01,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,Sky...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.70,0:16:20.66,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,所以我1个人就好
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.60,0:16:23.67,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我要1个人战斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.93,0:16:24.76,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,别这样...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.92,0:16:26.17,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,（轰鸣）
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.49,0:16:30.21,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,找到了！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.78,0:16:31.63,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,糟糕！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.79,0:16:33.64,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱暴
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.83,0:16:35.68,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.95,0:16:47.51,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,别跑！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.88,0:16:48.57,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.74,0:16:49.65,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,要被追上了！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.81,0:16:50.70,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,跳上去！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.80,0:16:59.28,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我去吸引他！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.47,0:17:03.43,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,不需要我说第二次了吧？你已经不是孤身1个人了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.71,0:17:09.91,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,就是因为不再孤独 我才害怕啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.56,0:17:11.64,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,不爽！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.85,0:17:18.07,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.47,0:17:25.29,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,我懂了！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.47,0:17:26.40,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.59,0:17:28.92,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,你要是害怕朋友受伤
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.10,0:17:30.84,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,那我就跟你断交！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.01,0:17:31.91,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,诶
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.86,0:17:36.41,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,从现在开始 我们就不是朋友了 而是搭档！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.51,0:17:37.87,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,这样你觉得如何？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.49,0:17:40.87,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,啥？你这只是文字游戏！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.06,0:17:43.06,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,那再换... 搭子！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.25,0:17:45.28,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,组合！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.81,0:17:46.87,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,配对！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.88,0:17:49.15,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,还有别的词吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.32,0:17:50.40,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我不知道！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.69,0:17:51.93,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.16,0:17:54.94,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我... 我们不是在吵架！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.12,0:17:57.02,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,对对！不要哭！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.21,0:17:58.36,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(690,1050)}你看！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.21,0:17:58.36,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(1240,1050)}你看！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.52,0:17:59.26,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.44,0:18:00.48,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.67,0:18:08.74,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.89,0:18:14.07,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.26,0:18:16.38,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小...小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.01,0:18:20.11,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,我不客气了！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.28,0:18:21.20,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,住手！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.54,0:18:29.97,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,真白同学...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.90,0:18:32.91,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,不要！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.69,0:18:35.88,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.79,0:18:38.16,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,哒！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.65,0:18:42.28,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,弱啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.03,0:18:44.09,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,闪光吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.91,0:18:47.10,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,呀！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.73,0:18:54.49,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,不行啊 我找不出“朋友”之外的词
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.44,0:18:56.57,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.00,0:19:00.17,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,我们不是搭档或是搭子这种关系
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.60,0:19:02.73,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,你是我的“朋友”
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.13,0:19:09.52,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,我担心你 我想帮助你 我们心意相通
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.94,0:19:13.67,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,这还不足以作为一起战斗的理由吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.76,0:19:26.79,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.66,0:19:30.30,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.87,0:19:33.27,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,眼睛...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.52,0:19:34.83,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱暴...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.22,0:19:38.89,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,敢耍小把戏！我生气了！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.21,0:19:42.11,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,我真的生气了！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.73,0:19:46.16,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.36,0:19:49.97,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,让你们见识一下什么是真正的强！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.42,0:19:55.72,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,我们上 Sky
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.92,0:19:57.20,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是 Prism
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.72,0:20:02.93,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,你终于原意叫我Prism了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.13,0:20:04.96,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,啊... 啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.81,0:20:16.05,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,Precure！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.87,0:20:25.54,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,这是...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.71,0:20:27.73,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,小空的新力量！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.51,0:20:40.64,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,天空蓝！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.51,0:20:40.64,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Sky Blue！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.79,0:20:45.22,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,棱镜白！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.79,0:20:45.22,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Prism White！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.80,0:21:02.53,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,卡...卡疤痛痛！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
