Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.29,0:21:35.79,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,能再继续握一会儿手吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.13,0:21:36.86,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.84,0:21:45.29,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空！小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.04,0:21:52.88,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,早饭做好了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.02,0:21:54.93,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,好的！我就来！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.67,0:22:05.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(700,0)\c&H535354&\frz285.2\pos(1304,533)}{\3c&H000000&\3a&HFF&\4c&H000000&\4a&HFF&\c&H3D3C3F&\fn@Droid Sans Fallback}两个人是Precure
